@startuml message_event_acceptance
title Events v2 Message Acceptance
' Contract baseline: pi-mono-java-design 2ee2a3211da68ad87b0d9cab353e691b00bdaebd
' Java baseline: ba9e497cd608fade88c97825bbd1d4b71a1c9e0e
' Implementation: 346d7f8fb16b4202e12dc6331b585d3921bec0c4
' Source: modules/coding-agent-cli/src/main/java/com/campusclaw/codingagent/runtimeapi/event/RuntimeV2MessageEventService.java#submitPrepared
' Source: modules/coding-agent-cli/src/main/java/com/campusclaw/codingagent/runtimeapi/persistence/RuntimeExecutionPersistenceService.java#acceptMessage
' Source: modules/coding-agent-cli/src/main/java/com/campusclaw/codingagent/runtimeapi/event/RuntimeEventStream.java#canAcceptRequired
' Pi source: packages/agent/src/agent-loop.ts#agentLoop and runAgentLoop at 4af9d21d3b4d664e4a29fcabfec85171077248e3
' Observed behavior: the Java service prepares one runtime snapshot before database acceptance.
' Design reason: a durable receipt must be queued before any execution output can be emitted.
' Java divergence: public receipt text is separated from the expanded internal prompt for security.
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
actor "Future HTTP handler" as http
participant "RuntimeV2MessageEventService" as service
participant "Session operation lock" as lock
participant "Runtime context factory" as context
participant "V2 encoder" as encoder
database "Execution persistence" as persistence
queue "RuntimeEventStream" as stream
participant "V2 coordinator" as coordinator

http -> service : submit user.message
service -> lock : serialize by session
lock -> context : prepare snapshot and internal prompt
context --> lock : context and holder
lock -> encoder : encode public receipt preview
encoder --> lock : required frame
lock -> stream : check required capacity
lock -> persistence : accept message and fixed target
persistence --> lock : committed receipt and target
lock -> stream : enqueue receipt first
lock -> coordinator : start accepted execution
coordinator --> lock : lifecycle attached
lock --> service : request stream
service --> http : stream

note over persistence,stream
Acceptance is one database transaction.
Execution starts only after the receipt is queued.
end note
@enduml
